This folder contains routines to evaluate SiB4.

The Makefile will compile the fortran routines, which 
can all be compiled by just typing 'make'. 
The routines can also be compiled individually by 
following make with the routine name.

---------------------------------------
pullflux.f90
-------------
Routine that pulls out SiB4 fluxes and Fluxnet
observations at all available tower sites.
It combines them, matching the times, and then
writes out a netcdf file containing the 
paired data for easy comparison.

The input file pullflux.txt contains the user
specifications, including:
  --Starting and stopping times
  --Directory containing SiB4 output
  --Directory containing Fluxnet data
  --Directory for output file
  --Tower information

It assumes the Fluxnet data all are in netcdf
files per tower, with separate files for
hourly, daily, and monthly output.  For SiB4,
it uses the hsib, psib, and qsib output, respectively.




